---
title: "Member Construction (stem-system types.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_auth: receive supabase_auth_user_id
    q_validate_auth --> q_validate_discord: validate auth user id is string
    q_validate_discord --> q_set_defaults: validate discord_uid is string
    q_set_defaults --> q_set_status: status = 0 (default)
    q_set_status --> q_set_generation: generation = number
    q_set_generation --> q_set_admin: is_admin = false (default)
    q_set_admin --> q_set_timestamps: joined_at = now()
    q_set_timestamps --> q_check_optional: deleted_at = null
    q_check_optional --> q_set_student: student_number != null
    q_check_optional --> q_set_username: student_number = null
    q_set_student --> q_set_username: student_number = string
    q_set_username --> q_final: discord_username = string or null
    q_final --> [*]: return Member

    note right of q_validate_auth
        INV-001: supabase_auth_user_id must be non-empty string
        INV-002: discord_uid must be non-empty string
        INV-003: generation must be positive integer
        INV-004: status must be valid numeric code
    end note
